# loose-issues.baseline — the loose-issue count `cckit doctor --loose --ratchet` holds the line at
# (E546.2). A loose issue is open, not an effort, not a sub-issue, has no relation line, and is not in Backlog.
# The number may only go down: when an issue is closed or filed under an effort, lower it in the
# same change. Not run by lib/core/check.sh (the gate stays offline); measured 2026-11-25 with a GET.
10
